# ~/.latexmkrc — always build PDF, never DVI.
# Managed by prof-workstation; do not edit directly.
#
# latexmk's own default (pdf_mode = 0) runs plain `latex` to DVI, which is
# almost never what a modern (pdf)LaTeX workflow wants. Setting pdf_mode = 1
# makes a bare `latexmk` behave like `latexmk -pdf` — run pdflatex straight
# to PDF — without having to remember the flag.
$pdf_mode = 1;
